{
    "title": "Word Search",
    "description": "Get the incredibly addicting word search game that everyone is talking about! Expand your vocabulary and show off your spelling skills as you search for all the hidden words.\r\n\r\nWord Search (also known as Word Seek, Word Find, Word Sleuth or Mystery Word) is a word game that consists of the letters of words placed in a grid. The objective of this puzzle is to find and mark all the words hidden inside the box. The words may be placed horizontally, vertically, or diagonally.\r\n\r\nWord Search Features:\r\n- 100+ different categories for your different moods\r\n- Starts off easy but gets challenging fast\r\n- Replay categories in Time mode or Classic mode\r\n- Daily challenges to earn extra rewards\r\n- Use the Hints when you get stuck\r\n- Enjoyable graphics with easy controls\r\n- NO WIFI? NO PROBLEM! Enjoy the word search puzzle anytime, anywhere!\r\n\r\nForget the pen and paper - You'll never experience a dull moment once you have this most addicting word search game!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get the incredibly addicting word search game that everyone is talking about! Expand your vocabulary and show off your spelling skills as you search for all the hidden words.<br><br>Word Search (also known as Word Seek, Word Find, Word Sleuth or Mystery Word) is a word game that consists of the letters of words placed in a grid. The objective of this puzzle is to find and mark all the words hidden inside the box. The words may be placed horizontally, vertically, or diagonally.<br><br>Word Search Features:<br>- 100+ different categories for your different moods<br>- Starts off easy but gets challenging fast<br>- Replay categories in Time mode or Classic mode<br>- Daily challenges to earn extra rewards<br>- Use the Hints when you get stuck<br>- Enjoyable graphics with easy controls<br>- NO WIFI? NO PROBLEM! Enjoy the word search puzzle anytime, anywhere!<br><br>Forget the pen and paper - You&#39;ll never experience a dull moment once you have this most addicting word search game!",
